  "aboutDescription1": "v4freedom is a fast, secure VPN app for every platform.",
  "aboutDescription2": "Connect with a single click using fresh free servers, or step up to Premium VPN for dedicated speed and quality. Bring your own server, sync everything across your devices, and stay in control of your connection.",
  "aboutDescription3": "Main features:\n- A fresh, modern design with dark and light themes.\n- Premium VPN plans for faster, more reliable connections.\n- Smart personal server setup: turn your own server into a VPN in a few taps.\n- Encrypted cloud storage: your configs and subscriptions are encrypted with your own passphrase and sync automatically across all your devices.\n- Import configs from files, links or QR codes, with .v4f file support.\n- Per-server details and usage, so you always know what you are using.\n- Smarter auto-connect to the best and fastest server for your network.\n- Extensive protocol support: v2ray (vmess, vless, trojan, shadowsocks, socks, WireGuard), SSH tunnel and WARP.\n- Our proprietary v4freedom protocol.\n- Full speed testing (tcping, real delay, httping) with sorting by speed.\n- Subscription groups with auto-update, speed sorting and smart configurations.\n- VPN mode and Proxy mode, advanced bypass and proxy rules, and per-app proxy.\n- DoH (DNS over HTTPS) settings for more private DNS.\n- Smart notifications by email, Telegram and push.\n- Referral and loyalty program: invite friends and get rewarded.\n- Per-device keys for stronger account security.\n- Ads blocker.\n- Available on mobile and desktop, in many languages.\n- Join the v4freedom community to share and discover VPN servers.",
  "aboutDescription4": "To install other versions of the app (Android, iOS, MacOs, Windows, Linux), reach out to v4freedom.com",
  "aboutDescription5": "To contact us, send an email to contact@v4freedom.com",
